mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/ss_4e299ddef2a677745ca2825f745c183ed0f37558.600x338.jpg?t=1740435472"}],"short_description":"The Animal Evolution Roguelite. Hunt, Flee, Scavenge &amp; Thrive in a living ecosystem. Evolve your creature in completely different ways with every run in this cute, highly replayable action roguelite. Adapt to survive the natural curve in order to beat Carcinisation...\u00a0or get Darwyn'd trying!","steam_appid":3526710,"support_info":{"email":"everythingiscrab@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}